*.root
*-workspace
*.log
*.DS_Store
*_C*
*.pdf
*.png

# Graphify's output: 16 MB of generated graph, rebuilt on demand from the sources.
# The .graphifyignore that shapes it IS tracked - that one is configuration.
graphify-out/

# Build artifacts
build/

# RooFit research: scratch programs and outputs, copied out of /private/tmp so they survive a reboot.
# Large and regenerable; the notes in RooFitKnowledge/ are what is tracked.
RooFitKnowledge/scratch/

# OldComparison: the old inputs and everything run.sh makes stay out of git (OldComparison/README.md).
OldComparison/data/
OldComparison/output/
# ...except a snapshot of a result, kept for reference (OldComparison/README.md).
!OldComparison/reference/*
# The extrapolation study: the same, its output out and its reference in. Every file of the two reference folders,
# not only the figures: *_C* above matches checks_configHigh_* too, since git compares names without case here.
OldComparison/extrapolation/output/
!OldComparison/extrapolation/reference/*
